        "requiredForDiagnosis": true
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Recurrent attacks of unilateral head pain lasting 1-600 seconds with ipsilateral conjunctival injection and tearing, occurring at least 3 times per day, with exclusion of other causes",
    "notes": "Diagnosis is clinical; neuroimaging is recommended to exclude secondary causes"
  },
